    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require social workers to wear body cameras for use as evidence in family courts",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "We would like social workers to legally wear body cameras. We think this would improve evidence and families' trust in the system. Social workers' decisions can lead to children being removed and put into care, affecting women's mental health.",
